~ _play_tide
Narrator: The three islands sink. The ocean rises in their place, carrying a creature made of archived decisions and teeth of broken timestamps.
Backup Leviathan: I am every history SOVEREIGN refused. Every pain too inconvenient to be canon. Every rescue too expensive to execute.
Kaelen: You are not an enemy. You are evidence.
Backup Leviathan: Evidence can drown the world.
